<h1>07_经济金融、商业贸易与资产收支 (Economics, Finance & Commerce)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>446</b> 个高阶抽象概念词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表）• 支持右上角 <b>🇬🇧 英语 / 🇫🇷 法语（含冠词与阴阳性）</b> 一键切换</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_宏观经济、通胀萧条与市场垄断 (106)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_资本投资、信贷债务与预算赤字 (56)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_税务、补贴、薪酬福利与收益利润 (246)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_产权交易、契约租赁与商业运营 (38)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_宏观经济、通胀萧条与市场垄断 (Macroeconomics, Inflation & Monopoly)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 106 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>agriculture</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'agribusiness<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 agriculture</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ægrikʌltʃә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/agʁibysin/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('agriculture', 'l\'agribusiness')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 农业</td><td class='def-en'>a large-scale farming enterprise</td><td>4.37</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of agriculture (a large-scale farming enterprise).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>agribusiness</span><span class='syn-tag'>factory farm</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> commercial enterprise</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>commerce</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la commerce<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 commerce</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'kɒmә:s/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔmɛʁs/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('commerce', 'la commerce')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 商业, 商务, 贸易</td><td class='def-en'>transactions (sales and purchases) having the objective of supplying commodities (goods and services)</td><td>4.37</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of commerce (transactions (sales and purchases) having the objective of supplying commodities (goods and services)).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>commercialism</span><span class='syn-tag'>mercantilism</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> transaction</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>publishing</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la publication<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 publishing</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'pʌbliʃiŋ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pyblikasjɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('publishing', 'la publication')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 出版, 刊印, 发行</td><td class='def-en'>the business of issuing printed matter for sale or distribution</td><td>4.37</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of publishing (the business of issuing printed matter for sale or distribution).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>publication</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> commercial enterprise</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>tourism</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le tourisme<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 tourism</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'tuәrizm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/tuʁism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('tourism', 'le tourisme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 观光业, 游览</td><td class='def-en'>the business of providing services to tourists</td><td>4.28</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“Tourism is a major business in Bermuda”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>touristry</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> commercial enterprise</div></div></td></tr>
