<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>yield</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la production<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 yield</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ji:ld/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pʁɔdyksjɔ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('yield', 'la production')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 生产量, 投资收益</td><td class='def-en'>production of a certain amount</td><td>4.16</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of yield (production of a certain amount).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>output</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> production</div></div></td></tr>
