<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_资本投资、信贷债务与预算赤字 (Capital, Debt, Credit & Deficit)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 56 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>asset</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'actif<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 asset</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'æset/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/aktif/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('asset', 'l\'actif')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 资产, 有益的东西</td><td class='def-en'>a useful or valuable quality</td><td>4.23</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of asset (a useful or valuable quality).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>plus</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> quality</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>bankruptcy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la banqueroute<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 bankruptcy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'bæŋkrәptsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bɑ̃kʁut/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('bankruptcy', 'la banqueroute')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 破产者</td><td class='def-en'>a state of complete lack of some abstract property</td><td>4.11</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“spiritual bankruptcy”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> failure</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>deficit</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le déficit<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 deficit</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'defisit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/defisit/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('deficit', 'le déficit')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 赤字, 不足额</td><td class='def-en'>the property of being an amount by which something is less than expected or required</td><td>4.06</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“new blood vessels bud out from the already dilated vascular bed to make up the nutritional deficit”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>shortage</span><span class='syn-tag'>shortfall</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> insufficiency</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>shortage</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le déficit<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 shortage</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ʃɒ:tidʒ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/defisit/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('shortage', 'le déficit')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 不足, 缺乏</td><td class='def-en'>the property of being an amount by which something is less than expected or required</td><td>3.91</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“new blood vessels bud out from the already dilated vascular bed to make up the nutritional deficit”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>deficit</span><span class='syn-tag'>shortfall</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> insufficiency</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>specialty</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la force<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 specialty</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'speʃәlti/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fɔʁs/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('specialty', 'la force')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 专业, 专长, 特产, 特制品, 特性, 特点</td><td class='def-en'>an asset of special worth or utility</td><td>3.89</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“cooking is his forte”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>forte</span><span class='syn-tag'>strong suit</span><span class='syn-tag'>long suit</span><span class='syn-tag'>metier</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> asset</div></div></td></tr>
